<title>PORTUGAL: European security summit opens.</title>
<headline>European security summit opens.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European security summit of more than 50 nations opened in Lisbon on Monday, hoping to lay the groundwork for peace in the 21st century but threatened by a row between Russia and the West over NATO expansion.</p>
<p>Portuguese Prime Minister Antonio Guterres opened the first session of the two-day summit shortly after 0900 GMT.</p>
